    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Poor lifestyle is one of the primary causes of developing cardiovascular disease. According to the World Health Organization over 17 million people die of cardiovascular diseases each year, a number which could come down substantially if people adopted heart-healthy lifestyle options.",
